OL,3,GNEWSADUP MP 'dumbfounded' at lack of
OL,4,Aresignations over Drumcree parade court
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) MP
OL,8,Fhas said she is "dumbfounded" that
OL,9,FParades Commission members have not
OL,10,F"already voluntarily resigned"
OL,11,Ffollowing a court ruling over one of
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland's most contentious
OL,13,Fparades.
OL,15,FThe High Court quashed a decision to
OL,16,Fimpose restrictions on the annual
OL,17,Fparade at Drumcree outside Portadown on
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
