OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADUP MP 'dumbfounded' at lack of
OL,4,Aresignations over Drumcree parade court
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe commission had banned this year's
OL,8,Fparade from the mainly nationalist
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road - a move which reflected
OL,10,Fevery decision it has made since 1998.
OL,12,FCarla Lockhart, DUP, said there would
OL,13,Fbe a fresh application to parade. Sinn
OL,14,FFein's John O'Dowd said it was
OL,15,F"completely beyond me" as to why the
OL,16,FDUP and Orange Order and others were
OL,17,F"refighting this battle".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
